mercial rights with the territories of the United Kingdom, United States, and France. ID X (7 points) and Y (8 points).", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:14:07Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Heroin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:14:08Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Viagra", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:14:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Y versailles", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:14:17Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Heroin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-24T04:14:30Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: X=heroin, Y=Versailles", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]